{{!-- Floating cart button with a red count badge, right side, just above whichever sticky buy bar is showing (on every page: the Sticky
      add to cart block .lu-satc.is-on, or the section's own bar #stickyAddToCart.show, else any fixed full-width bar at the bottom with a button / link, e.g. one inside a page body). Shown on every page, at every scroll position, on phone and desktop whenever the cart has items
      (hidden only with an empty cart): above the sticky bar while one is visible, else 20px from the bottom (count mirrored from the header bubble #cart-icon-bubble). Tap = open the cart. On a store page (advertorial) the theme header / footer are cut out, so with no #cart-icon-bubble
      the count comes from window.MSCart.count() (re-read whenever the page DOM changes, e.g. the cart drawer re-renders) and a tap calls MSCart.open().
      Back to top takes that slot (body.lu-cf-on) and the cart sits 54px above it while it shows (.ms-visible). --}}
